This license covers only this folder's own dev tooling (scripts/, test/,
tools/, eslint.config.mjs, package.json) and the replacement assets that
tools/make-replacements.mjs generates (four sound effects and the jump-dust
sprite sheet): the dependency-free serve/build scripts, the smoke tests, and
the small generator written here. It does NOT cover the rest of the game in
public/, which keeps its own licenses. See public/LICENSE (the game, MIT) and
public/CREDITS.md for each third-party asset.

